    <!-- Text colours are tinted towards each palette's accent rather than left neutral, so the
         whole screen — clock digits, dial hands, tick marks, labels — carries the theme's hue
         instead of only the accented details. Contrast against the background is kept well
         above the 4.5:1 mark so the clock stays readable at a glance. -->

